WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:08.144
Planning a business in France or the Netherlands? Start with your target country and where the team will actually operate.

00:00:08.794 --> 00:00:17.647
Describe the founders, planned activity, customer types, and intended launch date. Turn an idea into a clear project brief.

00:00:18.297 --> 00:00:25.705
Prepare an overview of identity documents, the proposed address, budget, and funding. List what you have and what is missing.

00:00:26.355 --> 00:00:33.404
Registration, tax, and licensing requirements need review by local professionals for your particular situation.

00:00:34.054 --> 00:00:41.806
Use the consultation link below. Tell us your target country, planned activity and timing so we can discuss the next step.
